reatens to cut  federal funding to cities that don't  comply in detaining people who were here  illegally and have been arrested for  unrelated crimes I'm here to say that  again I I believe in our sanctuary city  status Democratic mayor's in some of the  nation's largest cities are vowing to  fight the Trump administration I want to  say directly to anyone who feels  threatened today  well vulnerable  us safe in Boston I'm willing to lose  every single penny to protect those  people here in miami-dade County the  mayor says look following Trump's  executive order doesn't mean that his  officers are going to go out and become  an immigration force but Charlie he says  what could happen is if you're in the  country illegally and you violate the  law and go to jail for an unrelated  crime you may now be held in the county  jail until federal immigration  authorities pick you up  interesting David thank you
 

